[externally-managed]
Error=To install Python packages system-wide, try 'zoi install
 python-xyz', where xyz is the package you are trying to
 install.

 If you wish to install a Python package that is not packaged in
 Zoidberg, create a virtual environment using
 'python -m venv path/to/venv'. Then use path/to/venv/bin/python and
 path/to/venv/bin/pip.
